; NLC: which game materials soak blood in (blood pools and blood splats are multiplied into
; the ground instead of lying on top of it, and have no gloss). Matching is by lower-case
; substring of the material name. A material that matches [soft] and not [hard] is soft; all
; others are hard (asphalt, concrete, metal, wood...).
; List the material names in game with the console command: bpm mtl

[soft]
earth
grass
sand
dirt
soil
mud
clay
gravel
moss

[hard]
; names that contain a soft word but are not soft, e.g.:
; earth_concrete
